      "title": "The Future of Artificial Intelligence",
      "description": "Explore how artificial intelligence is transforming businesses, education, healthcare, and everyday life.",
      "content": "<h2>The Future of AI</h2><p>Artificial intelligence is rapidly changing the way we work and interact with technology. From intelligent assistants to advanced analytics, AI is becoming part of everyday life.</p><p>Organizations are increasingly using AI to automate repetitive tasks, improve decision making, and create personalized experiences.</p>",
