      "title": "10 Habits That Can Improve Your Productivity",
      "description": "Simple and practical habits that can help you stay focused, organized, and productive throughout the day.",
      "content": "<h2>Build Better Habits</h2><p>Productivity is not about working longer hours. It is about using your time effectively and focusing on the work that matters.</p><p>Start your day by identifying your most important tasks, eliminate distractions, and take regular breaks to maintain your energy.</p>",
